---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import AspCalendarView from '../components/AspCalendarView';
import '../styles/asp.css';
---

<Base
  title="Is Alternate Side Parking Suspended Today? NYC ASP Calendar · ParkSafe"
  description="Today's NYC alternate side parking status and every upcoming suspension, from the city's 311 calendar."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Alternate side parking today</h1>
    <p class="muted">
      New York City's alternate side parking (ASP) rules are suspended on legal and religious holidays and sometimes
      for weather. Street cleaning signs aren't enforced on those days. This page shows the city's 311 calendar.
    </p>
    <AspCalendarView client:load />
    <p class="fine-print">
      Source: NYC 311. Suspensions can be announced the same day, for snow for example. Meters may still be in effect
      when ASP is suspended; the day's details say which. <a href="/map/">See the signs on your block</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
